  "debrief": {
    "title": { "zh": "一共 6 条路线", "en": "6 routes in all" },
    "body": [
      {
        "zh": "你<b>没有列出任何一条路线</b>，却算出了一共 6 条。",
        "en": "You <b>didn’t list a single route</b>, yet you worked out that there are 6."
      },
      {
        "zh": "每个地点的数，都是用它前面地点的数算出来的：先解决小问题（到近处有几条路），再用这些答案拼出大问题的答案（到学校有几条路）。",
        "en": "Each place’s number was computed from the numbers of the places before it: first solve the small problems (how many routes reach the nearby places), then build the big answer out of those (how many reach School)."
      },
      {
        "zh": "<strong>这就是动态规划最核心的想法。</strong>",
        "en": "<strong>This is the core idea of dynamic programming.</strong>"
      }
    ],
    "note": {
      "zh": "到某地的路线数 = 到它所有「上一站」的路线数之和。",
      "en": "Routes to a place = the sum of the routes to all of its “previous stops”."
    }
  }
}
